{
  "name": "mud-workflow",
  "description": "MUD 声明式流程子包（纯架构）：流程本体 = JSON 声明式步骤表（schema + 注册表 + 解释器 + 五工具），进程内解释器执行（1 次工具调用、0 次模型调用），agent 经流程管理工具改进流程（进化闭环）。不含流程实体——数据归 core3（builtinFlows 启动期挂载）。",
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "test": "pnpm exec vitest run test",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.test.json"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "zod": "^4.4.3"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "^0.1.7-rc.2",
    "mud-core3": "workspace:^"
  }
}
